    "description": "Chasing Mode:\r\nPerform some Crazy Drifting Car Stunts to get escape from Rio City Police and show your crazy Rio city criminal skills.\r\nShooting Mode:\r\nFocus on your Target bottle or sweet fruit, shoot them and have a crazy bottle smash. Be the best Crazy Bullet Shooter and do more and more real bullet shooting.\r\nMega Ramp Mode:\r\nUse Stunt Racing Cars, Crazy Monster Truck, Extreme Heavy Trucks and Funny Vehicles for Amazing and Crazy Car Stunts on Mega Ramp in Gran City Rio.\r\nCar Racing Mode:\r\nStart Drift Car Racing on race track in Rio City and show you Crazy Driving Car Racing Skills.\r\nOpen World Mode:\r\nComplete your mission and be the crazy car thief in Real Grand Rio City. Get escape from City Rio police chasing and snatch citizen\u2019s Cars & kill them when needed. Perform like a best mafia gangster.\r\n\r\nReal Robbery Gangster Gun Shooting Car Racing Mega Ramp Police Chase Simulator Game is one of the most adventurous and challenging game. Do you want to become multi-talented game player??? Yes? Then, try this most thrilling game ever. You can increase your Real Bottle Shooting, Police Chase escaping, Real Mafia Gangster and Mega Ramp Car Racing in city crime. This Crazy Game has different challenging modes like:\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n-Variety of stunning customizable vehicles.\r\n-Extreme crazy 3D characters.\r\n-Real multiple shooting weapons.\r\n-High quality HD graphics with great physics.\r\n-Smooth play control with 3D environment.\r\n-Complete most challenging modes with different missions.\r\n-Interactive background sound.",
